@1. The prefixes that are taken
.
=1. THE PREFIXES THAT ARE TAKEN
.
.  GP.
.      OWNER: GPB.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: keywords, not variables -- see SEC 2, this one is
.        different
.
.  STR.
.      OWNER: STRINGS.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: string helpers
.
.  STR.USING.
.      OWNER: STRUSING.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: a number to a template, kept apart from the rest of STR.
.
.  THEME.
.      OWNER: THEME.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: colour roles
.
.  APPSYS.
.      OWNER: APPSYS.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: screen save/restore, panels to disk
.
.  LINEINPUT.
.      OWNER: LINEINPUT.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: entry fields
.
.  KB.
.      OWNER: KB.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the keyboard drain
.
.  MENUVERT.
.      OWNER: MENUVERT.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: vertical menus
.
.  BMX.
.      OWNER: BMX.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: BMX bitmap loading
.
.  BMXK.
.      OWNER: BMX.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: its KERNAL/VERA constants, kept apart from its variables
.
.  FILE.
.      OWNER: FILEIO.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the drive: status, exists, delete, rename, directories
.
.  FILE.DIR.
.      OWNER: FILEDIR.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: reading a directory, kept apart from the rest of FILE.
.
.  SV.
.      OWNER: STASHVRAM.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the VRAM store. SVGC. is STASHVRAMGC.INC.BL's one constant
.
.Pick anything else for your own program. AIRLIFT., GAME., MAP. -- a prefix
.costs nothing at runtime because BASLOAD crunches every identifier down to a
.short BASIC variable, so a long readable name and a two-letter one compile
.to exactly the same thing.
.
.Do not reuse a taken prefix for a name the module has not defined.
.THEME.MINE looks free today; it is one library update away from not being.
.
=SEE ALSO
.
>3|2. Using it
>48|4.2 STRINGS.INC.BL -- string helpers
>58|4.10 STRUSING.INC.BL -- a number to a template
>47|4.1 THEME.INC.BL -- named colour roles
>50|4.3 APPSYS.INC.BL -- start politely, leave it as you found it
>51|4.4 LINEINPUT.INC.BL -- a positioned entry field
>53|4.6 MENUVERT.INC.BL -- a vertical menu
>52|4.5 BMX.INC.BL -- a BMX bitmap into VERA
